 AA←OBSERVER SKYPOS GQ;LAT;DATE;TIME;SUN;ROT;ALT;AZ;S
⍝ Converts geocentric equatorial to altitude/azimuth
⍝ OBSERVER is LAT,DATE,TIME
 LAT DATE TIME←OBSERVER
 SUN←(24÷Data.YRLENGTH)×Data.YRLENGTH|DATE-Data.EQUINOX
 ROT←PI×(SUN+TIME-12)÷12
 LAT←RADIAN 90-LAT
 GQ←GQ÷⍉(⌽⍴GQ)⍴NORM GQ←CARTRIPLET GQ
 GQ←GQ+.×(LONGROTATE ROT)+.×LATROTATE LAT
 ALT←DEGREES ARCSIN GQ[;2]
 S←-×GQ[;3]
 AZ←(360×S≤0)+S×DEGREES ARCCOS(-GQ[;1])÷NORM GQ[;1 3]
 AA←ALT,[1.5]AZ
